{"text":"Who was I? I was certain Steve had made a mistake and that he would find me any day. And this was a real fear of mine. It kept me up at night. In fact, I didn't have a good night's rest from the day I got the role until the day I got wrapped on set. Before I left to shoot the film, I reached out to a close friend of mine and a classmate. I asked her where all the abandon and courage had disappeared to from all my time at Yale. What had I learned? And why wouldn't it show up when I needed it the most? My friend breathed with me. A good friend does that. And she reminded me that it was all there, that I needed to trust myself in order for what I had learned to serve me. Patsy's point of view had to matter to me more than my own. She reminded me to lead not with my fear, but with my hope. When you're living on purpose, the size of your human experience has got nothing to do with it.","words":[{"text":"Who","start":0.44,"end":0.84},{"text":"was","start":0.84,"end":1.02},{"text":"I","start":1.02,"end":1.38,"punct":"?"},{"text":"I","start":2.42,"end":2.66},{"text":"was","start":2.66,"end":2.8},{"text":"certain","start":2.8,"end":3.22},{"text":"Steve","start":3.22,"end":3.72},{"text":"had","start":3.72,"end":4.34},{"text":"made","start":4.34,"end":4.54},{"text":"a","start":4.54,"end":4.66},{"text":"mistake","start":4.66,"end":5.0},{"text":"and","start":5.0,"end":5.26},{"text":"that","start":5.26,"end":5.38},{"text":"he","start":5.38,"end":5.56},{"text":"would","start":5.56,"end":5.72},{"text":"find","start":5.72,"end":5.98},{"text":"me","start":5.98,"end":6.24},{"text":"any","start":6.24,"end":6.38},{"text":"day","start":6.38,"end":6.8,"punct":"."},{"text":"And","start":7.38,"end":7.56},{"text":"this","start":7.56,"end":7.68},{"text":"was","start":7.68,"end":7.82},{"text":"a","start":7.82,"end":7.98},{"text":"real","start":7.98,"end":8.32},{"text":"fear","start":8.32,"end":8.72},{"text":"of","start":8.72,"end":9.26},{"text":"mine","start":9.26,"end":9.52,"punct":"